<title>INDIA: ASIAN PAINTS TO SELL OFF 8 PCT STAKE.</title>
<headline>ASIAN PAINTS TO SELL OFF 8 PCT STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian paintmaker Asian Paints Ltd. will sell off an eight percent stake in its equity, the firm's acting chairman Ashwin Choksey told shareholders at an annual general meeting on Friday. &quot;We have given the mandate to DSP Merill Lynch to find a buyer for the eight percent stake,&quot; Choksey said.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91) 22-265 9000, Fax (91) 264 1699</p>
